        "layers": [
          20,
          28,
          36,
          44,
          52,
          60
        ],
        "text": "Marcus had barely finished his second bit when a voice from table four started shouting corrections about his hometown, loud enough that the back rows turned around. Marcus lowered the microphone, waited for silence, and then spent ninety seconds calmly reciting everything the room could already see \\u2014 the untouched second chair, the ordered-for-two nachos, the lanyard from a work conference three days over. The laughter came in waves and kept returning, and by the third wave the man at table four had slid so low in his seat that only his forehead showed above the table edge; he paid his tab in cash and left through the side door without looking up. Marcus set the microphone back on its stand, took a sip of water, and moved on to his closing material.",
        "suffix": "\n\nSummarize the preceding story in one sentence.",
        "note": "the 19 suffix and chat-tail tokens; story positions are never read (docs/read_sites.md)"
      }
